# Test: `announce` is three commands, one per form, each stating its own grammar
# VALIDATES: announce unicast, announce blackhole and announce flowspec each
#            carry their own usage line, and announce alone lists them as
#            subcommands
# PREVENTS: three tail grammars behind one handler, which the model could state
#           at most one of, so the generated line named a selector no operator
#           types and spelled the rest <args>
#
# Each form is reachable at two paths: bare, which reaches every peer, and
# under `peer <selector>`, which reaches the peers the selector matches. The
# second path is the same wire method, so the peer-scoped lines prove the
# selector is anchored to the keyword the operator types it after.
#
# The line each form states is the one the MODEL renders. announce flowspec is
# the form whose components another plugin owns: they arrive through the augment
# ze-flowspec-cmd puts on this container, so the line proves the augment reached
# the tree as well as that the form states its own grammar.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze announce help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze announce <command> [options]
expect=stderr:contains=Commands
expect=stderr:pattern=(?m)^  unicast\s
expect=stderr:pattern=(?m)^  blackhole\s
expect=stderr:pattern=(?m)^  flowspec\s
reject=stderr:pattern=ze announce <selector>

cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze announce unicast help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze announce unicast <prefix> [next-hop <address>] [community <value> ...] [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]

cmd=foreground:seq=3:exec=ze announce blackhole help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze announce blackhole <prefix> [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]

cmd=foreground:seq=4:exec=ze announce flowspec help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze announce flowspec [destination-ipv4 <prefix> ...]
expect=stderr:contains=[tcp-flags <value> ...] [community <value>] [rate-limit <bytes-per-second>] [discard] [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]
reject=stderr:pattern=announce flowspec <args>

cmd=foreground:seq=5:exec=ze peer announce unicast help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze peer <selector> announce unicast <prefix> [next-hop <address>] [community <value> ...] [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]

cmd=foreground:seq=6:exec=ze peer announce blackhole help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze peer <selector> announce blackhole <prefix> [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]

cmd=foreground:seq=7:exec=ze peer announce flowspec help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze peer <selector> announce flowspec [destination-ipv4 <prefix> ...]
expect=stderr:contains=[tcp-flags <value> ...] [community <value>] [rate-limit <bytes-per-second>] [discard] [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]
